_004","text":"Lab Report: Training dynamics of deep models","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s1","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s2","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"The dataset was split into 70 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s3","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"Each experiment was repeated 5 times with different random seeds.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s4","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s5","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"ViT-S reaches about 90% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s6","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"As shown in Figure 1, ViT-S reaches 84.7% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s7","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"As shown in Figure 1, on SVHN, ViT-S obtains a accuracy of 85.6%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s8","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score of MLP by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s9","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"As shown in Figure 2, MLP achieves 62.2% F1 score on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s10","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"On MNIST, MLP obtains a F1 score of 21.5%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s11","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"Figure 3 shows the validation accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s12","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"From epoch 3 to epoch 4, the validation accuracy of ResNet-50 improves by a relative 10.7%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s13","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"ResNet-50 reaches 62.8% validation accuracy at epoch 6 (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s14","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"As shown in Figure 3, at epoch 3, CNN is 16 points better than ResNet-50.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s15","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"Figure 4 shows the validation accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s16","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"Baseline reaches 60.9% validation accuracy at epoch 6 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s17","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"BERT-base outperforms VGG-16 by about 16 percentage points at epoch 10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s18","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"Logistic Regression reaches 86.2% accuracy on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_004_s19","report_id":"holdout3_004","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}